  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">S. Africa Trade Desk</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Trade Desk of the Alliance for Justice and Peace in Southern Africa aims to address the marginalisation of poor rural communities within Southern Africa through increasing their voice and participation in government decision-making and attempting to reshape governmental agricultural and trade policies through critical engagement so that they address the needs of poor rural communities. The Trade Desk aims to work at two levels: in South Africa through Justice and Peace&#x2019;s network of community based local groups and in Southern Africa through select Justice and Peace National offices.</narrative>
  </description>
